<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets Lai Sun Dev warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets Lai Sun Dev warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Wednesday it has launched 225 million American-style call warrants on shares of Lai Sun Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$9.10	PREMIUM	 8.77 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.3192    GEARING	 3.5X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  13.NOV.97    SETTLEMENT    28.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$11.30</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
